{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014fV8sMQhSvD2jN1LbZXgAj","type":"tool_result","content":"tools/game/template/AGENTS.md.tmpl\ntools/game/template/CLAUDE.md.tmpl\ntools/game/template/ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md.tmpl\ntools/game/template/GEMINI.md.tmpl\ntools/game/template/README.md.tmpl\ntools/game/template/claude-settings.json.tmpl\ntools/game/template/gitignore.tmpl\ntools/game/template/index.html.tmpl\n\ntools/game/template:\nAGENTS.md.tmpl\nCLAUDE.md.tmpl\nENGINE-FEEDBACK.md.tmpl\nGEMINI.md.tmpl\nREADME.md.tmpl\nclaude-settings.json.tmpl\ngitignore.tmpl\nindex.html.tmpl\n---\n---\nlabs/playground/README.md\nlabs/playground/controls.test.ts\nlabs/playground/controls.ts\nlabs/playground/feel.test.ts\nlabs/playground/feel.ts\nlabs/playground/furnish.ts\nlabs/playground/ground.ts\nlabs/playground/index.html\nlabs/playground/main.ts\nlabs/playground/touch.ts\nlabs/playground/tour.test.ts\nlabs/playground/tour.ts\nlabs/playground/views.test.ts\nlabs/playground/views.ts\nlabs/playground/weather.test.ts\nlabs/playground/weather.ts\n\nlabs/playground:\nREADME.md\nbodies\ncast\ncontrols.test.ts\ncontrols.ts\ncourses\nfeel.test.ts\nfeel.ts\nfurnish.ts\nground.ts\nindex.html\nlevels\nlooks\nmain.ts\nprops\nscenes\nsounds\ntouch.ts\ntour.test.ts\ntour.ts\nui\nviews.test.ts\nviews.ts\nweapons\nweather.test.ts\nweather.ts\n\nlabs/playground/bodies:\nneighbours.test.ts\nneighbours.ts\nplayer.test.ts\nplayer.ts\n\nlabs/playground/cast:\ndog.test.ts\ndog.ts\ndummies.test.ts\ndummies.ts\nhealth.ts\nneighbours.test.ts\nneighbours.ts\npartners.test.ts\npartners.ts\nplayer.ts\nways.ts\n\nlabs/playground/courses:\nair.ts\nbounds.ts\ncamera-walls.ts\ncameras.ts\nclimb.ts\nclimbAgain.ts\ncourses.test.ts\ncrawl.ts\ncrouch.ts\nfences.ts\ngaps.ts\nhang.ts\nhill.ts\njumps.ts\nladder.ts\nlanding.ts\nlauncher.ts\nmantle.ts\nrange.ts\nskydive.ts\nslideFlat.ts\nslideJump.ts\nslideRamps.ts\nsteps.ts\nstrip.ts\nsuperglide.ts\nzipline.ts\n\nlabs/playground/levels:\ngym.ts\nhouse.test.ts\nhouse.ts\nplan.ts\nsite.ts\nstreet.ts\nyard.ts\n\nlabs/playground/looks:\ncel.ts\nclean.ts\nlooks.test.ts\npixel.ts\npixelPerspective.ts\n\nlabs/playground/props:\nhouse.ts\noutdoors.ts\nprops.test.ts\n\nlabs/playground/scenes:\ngym.test.ts\ngym.ts\nhill.test.ts\nhill.ts\nring.test.ts\nsite-areas.test.ts\nsite-cut.test.ts\nsite-downstairs.test.ts\nsite-eye.test.ts\nsite-lights.test.ts\nsite-soak.test.ts\nsite-upstairs.test.ts\nsite.test.ts\nsite.ts\n\nlabs/playground/sounds:\neffects.ts\nevents.test.ts\nevents.ts\nground.test.ts\nground.ts\npage.test.ts\npage.ts\n\nlabs/playground/ui:\nareas.test.ts\nareas.ts\nattract.ts\ncheckList.ts\ncheckPanel.ts\nchecks.test.ts\nchecks.ts\nframe.test.ts\nframe.ts\nfrontEnd.test.ts\n---\n# The starter game\n\nEvery game made with my-3dge starts as this one (`node tools/game/new-game.mjs`), then becomes its own: rewrite this\npage as the game grows. It is the game's page for the owner and the next agent: what the game is, how it plays, how to\nsee it, and the calls made along the way.\n\n## The game\n\nRun round the arena collecting every gem before the clock runs out. WASD or the arrows run, Space jumps (over the low\nwalls), Shift dashes. All the gems: won. The clock at 0: lost. Enter starts a new round on the next seed.\n\n## Files\n\n| File                              | What it is                                                                    |\n| --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| labs/game/scenes/play.ts          | The rules, sim-side: the arena's text, the settings, the gems, the round, the systems |\n| labs/game/cast/player.ts          | The player: its character (run, jump, dash) and the body it is drawn as        |\n| labs/game/bot.ts                  | The bot: plays through intents, down the flow field to the nearest gem         |\n| labs/game/main.ts, index.html     | The page: the engine, the HUD, Enter to play again, the chase camera           |\n| labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts     | The tests: the golden replay, capture and restore, the bot wins on 10 seeds, the clock |\n| labs/game/replays/bot.replay.json | The bot's play from seed 1, with its golden hashes                             |\n\n## Settings\n\n`game.gems` (10), `game.seconds` (30) and `game.speed` (6 m/s), read when the round starts: `?game.gems=20` in the\npage, `--set game.gems=20` for `node x sim` and `node x shot`.\n\n## See it\n\n```sh\nnpm run dev                                         # http://127.0.0.1:5173/labs/game/ (?replay=bot plays the bot's run)\nnpm test                                            # the tests\nnode x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts --feel          # the rules in Node: hash, events, how the player handles\nnode x shot labs/game                               # the page on WebGPU, as numbers\nnode x replay labs/game/replays --browser sim       # the goldens, in Node and Chromium\n```\n\n## Decisions\n\n<!-- The calls made without the owner, newest first: the date, what was decided, why. -->","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c3db9ff-22de-4370-a6c8-816de35b9215","uuid":"1f2af965-9436-46ae-95fc-1fd697305458","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:23:49.221Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"tools/game/template/AGENTS.md.tmpl\ntools/game/template/CLAUDE.md.tmpl\ntools/game/template/ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md.tmpl\ntools/game/template/GEMINI.md.tmpl\ntools/game/template/README.md.tmpl\ntools/game/template/claude-settings.json.tmpl\ntools/game/template/gitignore.tmpl\ntools/game/template/index.html.tmpl\n\ntools/game/template:\nAGENTS.md.tmpl\nCLAUDE.md.tmpl\nENGINE-FEEDBACK.md.tmpl\nGEMINI.md.tmpl\nREADME.md.tmpl\nclaude-settings.json.tmpl\ngitignore.tmpl\nindex.html.tmpl\n---\n---\nlabs/playground/README.md\nlabs/playground/controls.test.ts\nlabs/playground/controls.ts\nlabs/playground/feel.test.ts\nlabs/playground/feel.ts\nlabs/playground/furnish.ts\nlabs/playground/ground.ts\nl