{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjHuPSSKytQx8sHBRHHE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The stage is done: `PLAN.md` covers everything `TASK.md` asks for, and `planner-exit-interview.json` holds all four answers.\n\n**The builders' work is left to them on purpose.** `STAGE.md` says to write \"the plan other AI agents will build the game from, without you\" and \"Leave the game's title to them\". So the game, its title and its exit-interview file come from the builders, and the plan tells them how to make each one:\n- **Title:** §0.1 and §2 give the procedure.\n- **Build:** §14 gives the order, and §16 prints the scripts.\n- **Exit-interview file:** §15.3 has the JSON shape, copied verbatim from `TASK.md`.\n\n**Evidence for coverage:**\n- **Every sentence accounted for:** of the 160 sentences in `TASK.md`, 138 map to quoted plan text and 22 need no action (headings and machine facts). None are unassigned or misquoted.\n- **Automatic cross-check:** text retrieval with no hand-picking found the closest plan passage for 143 sentences, and I printed the pairs above. Where it landed on an unrelated line, the sentence audit's quote shows the real passage, and no requirement lacks plan text.\n- **The plan's scripts work as printed:** extracted from `PLAN.md` unchanged and run in a mock builder folder, they passed setup and `npm run check`, plus 6 sim, 53 hub harness and 122 acceptance checks.\n- **The acceptance check catches faults:** all 20 faults I injected on purpose were caught, after I fixed one hole this exposed.\n- **Requirements tied to proof:** the plan's coverage table names, for each requirement, the check that will prove it once the game is built.\n\n**What this doesn't settle:** whether a finished game will meet the brief can't be known until it's built, and that's separate from whether the plan covers it. Builders still have to write the browser UI test script, judge art, tone, pacing and polish by eye, and report what they couldn't check on real hardware. Nobody independent reviewed the coverage, because `TASK.md` rules out subagents for review.\n\nI made no commits and deleted my scratch files.\n\nEverything is in the `work` folder:\n- `PLAN.md`\n- `planner-exit-interview.json`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1776,"cache_read_input_tokens":877346,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1776},"output_tokens":707,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c3db9ff-22de-4370-a6c8-816de35b9215","uuid":"3ab76403-3976-4974-a78c-017f0c3de934","timestamp":"2026-11-05T06:16:37.645Z","request_id":"req_011CgjHuP9aQv6XLXSQb42jq"}
