h detail, enemies, effects, lights and shadows as the scene needs.')\na('Out of scope (handled','FPS targets and optimization are out of scope.')\na('Testing: Test as much','Headless scripts that play the game and check its state, including a scripted playthrough of the whole game')\na('Keep them behind one','behind one command that prints only failures and a one-line count, rerun only after changing the code it covers.')\na('Use screenshots only','Screenshots only for what a script can\\'t check.')\na(\"Don't use subagents\",'No subagents or workflows to debate, review, judge or audit')\na('Effort: Spend','Effort. Spend it however you see fit.')\na('Checked 2026-11-04','as checked 2026-11-04 20:05 (America/Vancouver) by node check-environment.mjs')\na('- Computer:','Worki9, 13th Gen Intel i9-13900K, 32 cores, 20 GB RAM, 8 GB swap')\na('Ubuntu 26.04.1','Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS on WSL2 (Linux 6.18.33.1-microsoft-standard-WSL2).')\na('- Space:','850 GB free in the home folder; /tmp is 9.8 GB in memory (tmpfs), 8.2 GB free when checked.')\na('- Display:','No display in runs (DISPLAY unset).','so skip headed mode and xvfb.')\na('- Browsers:','Use --enable-unsafe-webgpu --enable-features=Vulkan --use-vulkan=swiftshader --use-angle=swiftshader.')\na('Phone and tablet device','phone and tablet profiles built in.')\na('WebGPU only works','WebGPU needs a secure page: file:// or http://127.0.0.1.')\na('A WebGPU canvas','A WebGPU canvas can come out blank in a headless screenshot, so check the game\\'s state instead.')\na('For Node, npm install','you don\\'t need npm install playwright@1.63.0.')\na('Playwright runs here','Leave PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE as it is set.')\na('- Tools:','Tools: node 24.22.1, npm 11.19.1')\na('- Rust:',\"Rust: rustup's toolchains 1.96.0, 1.98.1 and stable\")\na('- Not installed:','Not installed: sox, bun, deno.')\na('- Network:','Internet works (github.com, registry.npmjs.org).')\na('- Memory:','means memory ran out (earlyoom), not a bug in your