{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjJEHfTgMYp2U1XFBHsz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No change this time: I've done everything in this stage that I can do without breaking its rules.\n\nThe hook now wants a check by someone other than me, and I can't produce that myself. Appendix A in `PLAN.md` is what an outside checker needs: every sentence of `TASK.md` beside the plan's matching words. But it only counts once someone else has read it. The one way I could get an outside read is a review subagent, and `TASK.md` rules those out. A blocked stop doesn't change that, so I won't run one on my own, and repeating my own checks wouldn't count as independent.\n\nI stand by the result: `PLAN.md` covers the brief, and `planner-exit-interview.json` is saved. The game itself is still for the builders, as `STAGE.md` says.\n\nThis needs you to do one of these:\n- **Check it yourself:** read Appendix A beside `TASK.md`, then end the goal with `/goal clear`.\n- **End it now:** run `/goal clear` if you don't need the check.\n- **Get a second opinion:** tell me to run an independent review, and I'll treat that as lifting the subagent rule for this one check."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":916960,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c3db9ff-22de-4370-a6c8-816de35b9215","uuid":"e4b6ac24-91e6-4e55-a847-298783d8a0b3","timestamp":"2026-11-05T06:21:06.401Z","request_id":"req_011CgjJEHLcUMdzmhkwk3SJd"}
